V0.4 changes (from V0.3_XIAO):
  - mag is now a float (int rounded every turn under 1 g down to 0, so turns never animated)
  - Level calibration at startup: keep the car still while it wakes up
  - Readings are smoothed so bumps and potholes don't set it off
  - Fixed holdingLeft = 1 typo and Serial baud rate (115200)

TODOs:

Driving Dynamics:
  Turning
    Regular Turn (>0.2 g)
      Slide 3

    Hard Turn (>0.5 g)
      Slide 3
      Slide 2 
      
    Racing Turn (>0.6 g)
      Slide 1 / 0

  Accelerating
    Hard Acceleation (0.3 g)
      Shocked 

    Racing Acceleration (0.5 g)
      Speeding 3 / 4

  Breaking
    Regular Breaking (___ g)

    Hard Break (0.5 g)
      Shocked 
      Stop

    Emergency Breaking (___ g)
      Shocked 
      Stop 



Image Processing: 
  Shrink image sizes
  create a new file to store all images 

NEW MICRO CONTROLLER MIGRATING
  Scale images to make use of 128 x 128 OLED 
  General SEEDUINO XIAO Micro controller migrating 

*/


